<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Genesis, the blueprint —</l><l>Revelation, the fulfillment —</l><l>From God’s plan and economy</l><l>To the city in eternity.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Man from the dust of the ground</l><l>At the end, New Jerusalem.</l><l>Here God’s wisdom and love abound.</l><l>Oh! This is most profound!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Deep in God’s heart He planned</l><l>To mingle Himself with man.</l><l>God, as a river and a tree,</l><l>Man’s food and drink to be.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>God our enjoyment</l><l>Issues the fulfillment:</l><l>A city as His expression</l><l>Built with gold, pearl and precious stones.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
